-- trial.rofl — WHAT THE WRITER ASSERTS FOR A TRIAL, as a file, so both engines
-- answer `breaks`. store.ts marks the candidate `trial(E)` and lists every
-- defect the world had without it as `before(Day, Reason, Where)`. Here two
-- entries of the fixture are tried: e_nannyadd touches Monday, whose three
-- on-foot defects are all listed, so it breaks nothing; e_schoolmv touches
-- Thursday, whose red block is not listed, so it breaks — which is the
-- positive control. Not read by the tool.
trial(e_nannyadd).
trial(e_schoolmv).
before(mon, on_foot_unknown, home).
before(mon, on_foot_unknown, sadik).
before(mon, on_foot_unknown, school).
-- S3c (2026-09-16): two dated exceptions tried too — alex's Thursday carry, whose clash with work_pm is a defect of the
-- day (carrier_busy) not listed in `before`, so it breaks by that name; and the nanny's Wednesday hours, which touch wed
trial(e_kitthu).
trial(e_nannywed).
